{"game":"Noita","source":"core","apworld":null,"world_version":"1.4.0","groups":[{"name":"Game Options","collapsed":false,"options":[{"key":"progression_balancing","name":"Progression Balancing","kind":"named_range","doc":"A system that can move progression earlier, to try and prevent the player from getting stuck and bored early.\n\nA lower setting means more getting stuck. A higher setting means less getting stuck.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>A system that can move progression earlier, to try and prevent the player from getting stuck and bored early.</p>\n<p>A lower setting means more getting stuck. A higher setting means less getting stuck.</p>\n","min":0,"max":99,"default":50,"special":{"disabled":0,"normal":50,"extreme":99}},{"key":"accessibility","name":"Accessibility","kind":"choice","doc":"Set rules for reachability of your items/locations.\n\n**Full:** ensure everything can be reached and acquired.\n\n**Minimal:** ensure what is needed to reach your goal can be acquired.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Set rules for reachability of your items/locations.</p>\n<p><strong>Full:</strong> ensure everything can be reached and acquired.</p>\n<p><strong>Minimal:</strong> ensure what is needed to reach your goal can be acquired.</p>\n","choices":[{"value":"full","label":"Full","id":0},{"value":"minimal","label":"Minimal","id":2}],"aliases":{"items":"full","locations":"full","none":"minimal"},"default":"full"},{"key":"death_link","name":"Death Link","kind":"toggle","doc":"When you die, everyone who enabled death link dies. Of course, the reverse is true too.\n\nYou can disable this or set it to give yourself a trap effect when another player dies in the in-game mod options.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>When you die, everyone who enabled death link dies. Of course, the reverse is true too.</p>\n<p>You can disable this or set it to give yourself a trap effect when another player dies in the in-game mod options.</p>\n","default":"false"},{"key":"bad_effects","name":"Traps","kind":"toggle","doc":"Whether negative effects on the Noita world are added to the item pool.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"true"},{"key":"victory_condition","name":"Victory Condition","kind":"choice","doc":"Greed is to get to the bottom, beat the boss, and win the game.\nPure is to get 11 orbs, grab the sampo, and bring it to the mountain altar.\nPeaceful is to get all 33 orbs, grab the sampo, and bring it to the mountain altar.\nOrbs will be added to the randomizer pool based on which victory condition you chose.\nThe base game orbs will not count towards these victory conditions.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"choices":[{"value":"greed_ending","label":"Greed Ending","id":0},{"value":"pure_ending","label":"Pure Ending","id":1},{"value":"peaceful_ending","label":"Peaceful Ending","id":2}],"aliases":{},"default":"greed_ending"},{"key":"path_option","name":"Path Option","kind":"choice","doc":"Choose where you would like Hidden Chest and Pedestal checks to be placed.\nMain Path includes the main 7 biomes you typically go through to get to the final boss.\nSide Path includes the Lukki Lair and Fungal Caverns. 9 biomes total.\nMain World includes the full world (excluding parallel worlds). 15 biomes total.\nNote: The Collapsed Mines have been combined into the Mines as the biome is tiny.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"choices":[{"value":"main_path","label":"Main Path","id":1},{"value":"side_path","label":"Side Path","id":2},{"value":"main_world","label":"Main World","id":3}],"aliases":{},"default":"main_path"},{"key":"hidden_chests","name":"Hidden Chests per Biome","kind":"range","doc":"Number of hidden chest checks added to the applicable biomes.\nNote: The number of hidden chests that spawn per run in each biome varies.\nYou are expected do multiple runs to get all of your checks.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":0,"max":20,"default":3},{"key":"pedestal_checks","name":"Pedestal Checks per Biome","kind":"range","doc":"Number of checks that will spawn on pedestals in the applicable biomes.\nNote: The number of pedestals that spawn per run in each biome varies.\nYou are expected do multiple runs to get all of your checks.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":0,"max":20,"default":6},{"key":"orbs_as_checks","name":"Orbs as Location Checks","kind":"choice","doc":"Decides whether finding the orbs that naturally spawn in the world count as checks.\nThe Main Path option includes only the Floating Island and Abyss Orb Room orbs.\nThe Side Path option includes the Main Path, Magical Temple, Lukki Lair, and Lava Lake orbs.\nThe Main World option includes all 11 orbs.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"choices":[{"value":"no_orbs","label":"No Orbs","id":0},{"value":"main_path","label":"Main Path","id":1},{"value":"side_path","label":"Side Path","id":2},{"value":"main_world","label":"Main World","id":3}],"aliases":{},"default":"no_orbs"},{"key":"bosses_as_checks","name":"Bosses as Location Checks","kind":"choice","doc":"Makes bosses count as location checks. The boss only needs to die, you do not need the kill credit.\nThe Main Path option includes Gate Guardian, Suomuhauki, and Kolmisilmä.\nThe Side Path option includes the Main Path bosses, Sauvojen Tuntija, and Ylialkemisti.\nThe All Bosses option includes all 15 bosses.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"choices":[{"value":"no_bosses","label":"No Bosses","id":0},{"value":"main_path","label":"Main Path","id":1},{"value":"side_path","label":"Side Path","id":2},{"value":"all_bosses","label":"All Bosses","id":3}],"aliases":{},"default":"no_bosses"},{"key":"extra_orbs","name":"Extra Orbs","kind":"range","doc":"Add extra orbs to your item pool, to prevent you from needing to wait as long for the last orb you need for your victory condition.\nExtra orbs received past your victory condition's amount will be received as hearts instead.\nCan be turned on for the Greed Ending goal, but will only really make it harder.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":0,"max":10,"default":0},{"key":"shop_price","name":"Shop Price Reduction","kind":"choice","doc":"Reduce the costs of Archipelago items in shops.\nBy default, the price of Archipelago items matches the price of wands at that shop.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"choices":[{"value":"75_percent_off","label":"75 Percent Off","id":25},{"value":"50_percent_off","label":"50 Percent Off","id":50},{"value":"25_percent_off","label":"25 Percent Off","id":75},{"value":"full_price","label":"Full Price","id":100}],"aliases":{},"default":"full_price"}]},{"name":"Item & Location Options","collapsed":true,"options":[{"key":"local_items","name":"Local Items","kind":"set","doc":"Forces these items to be in their native world.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Forces these items to be in their native world.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"items","name_groups":true},{"key":"non_local_items","name":"Non-local Items","kind":"set","doc":"Forces these items to be outside their native world.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Forces these items to be outside their native world.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"items","name_groups":true},{"key":"start_inventory","name":"Start Inventory","kind":"counter","doc":"Start with the specified amount of these items. Example: {Bomb: 1, Arrow: 3} ","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Start with the specified amount of these items. Example: {Bomb: 1, Arrow: 3}</p>\n","default":{},"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"items","min":null,"max":10000},{"key":"start_inventory_from_pool","name":"Start Inventory from Pool","kind":"counter","doc":"Start with the specified amount of these items and don't place them in the world. Example: {Bomb: 1, Arrow: 3}\n\nThe game decides what the replacement items will be.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Start with the specified amount of these items and don't place them in the world. Example: {Bomb: 1, Arrow: 3}</p>\n<p>The game decides what the replacement items will be.</p>\n","default":{},"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"items","min":null,"max":10000},{"key":"start_hints","name":"Start Hints","kind":"set","doc":"Start with these item's locations prefilled into the ``!hint`` command.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Start with these item's locations prefilled into the <tt class=\"docutils literal\">!hint</tt> command.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"items","name_groups":true},{"key":"start_location_hints","name":"Start Location Hints","kind":"set","doc":"Start with these locations and their item prefilled into the ``!hint`` command.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Start with these locations and their item prefilled into the <tt class=\"docutils literal\">!hint</tt> command.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"locations","name_groups":true},{"key":"exclude_locations","name":"Excluded Locations","kind":"set","doc":"Prevent these locations from having an important item.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Prevent these locations from having an important item.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"locations","name_groups":true},{"key":"priority_locations","name":"Priority Locations","kind":"set","doc":"Prevent these locations from having an unimportant item.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Prevent these locations from having an unimportant item.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"locations","name_groups":true},{"key":"item_links","name":"Item Links","kind":"plando","doc":"Share part of your item pool with other players.","weighted":false,"visibility":13,"doc_html":"<p>Share part of your item pool with other players.</p>\n","default":[]},{"key":"plando_items","name":"Plando Items","kind":"plando","doc":"Generic items plando.","weighted":false,"visibility":9,"default":[]}]}],"extra_keys":[],"items":["All-Seeing Eye Perk","Broken Wand","Chaos D